    <div class="page-body">
      
      
      
      <h3>Core SEO</h3>
      
      <ul class="findings">
        
        <li class="finding fail">
          <span class="word">FAIL</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Meta description present <code class="rule">core-seo/meta-description-present</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">Missing meta description</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Add a &#60;meta name=&#34;description&#34;&#62; with a 70 to 160 character summary of the page.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding fail">
          <span class="word">FAIL</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Viewport meta present <code class="rule">core-seo/viewport-present</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">Missing viewport meta</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Add &#60;meta name=&#34;viewport&#34; content=&#34;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&#34;&#62; for mobile rendering.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Title length <code class="rule">core-seo/title-length</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">Title is short (6 chars)</p>
            <pre dir="auto"><code>Orphan</code></pre>
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Rewrite the title to sit between 30 and 60 characters so it is not truncated in search results.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Meta description length <code class="rule">core-seo/meta-description-length</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No description to measure</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Trim or expand the meta description to 70 to 160 characters.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">H1 length <code class="rule">core-seo/h1-length</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">H1 is short (6 chars)</p>
            <pre dir="auto"><code>Orphan</code></pre>
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Rewrite the H1 to sit between 10 and 70 characters. One word says nothing; a sentence is not a heading.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Canonical URL present <code class="rule">core-seo/canonical-present</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No canonical link</p>
            
