          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Open Graph basics <code class="rule">core-seo/open-graph-basics</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">Missing Open Graph tags: og:title, og:description, og:image</p>
            
