          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Published or updated date <code class="rule">eeat/date</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No published or updated date found</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Show a published or last-updated date. Freshness and transparency are trust signals.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding info">
          <span class="word">INFO</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Outbound citations <code class="rule">eeat/outbound-citations</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No outbound citations</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Cite authoritative external sources. Outbound links to reputable sites support your claims.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding info">
          <span class="word">INFO</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">About page <code class="rule">eeat/about-page</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No about page link found</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Link to an about page that explains who is behind the site. It is a core trust signal.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
      </ul>
      
      
      
      <h3>Performance</h3>
      
      <ul class="findings">
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Text compression <code class="rule">performance/text-compression</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">HTML response is not compressed</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Enable gzip or Brotli compression on HTML, CSS, and JS responses to cut transfer size.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
        <li class="finding warn">
          <span class="word">WARN</span>
          <div class="finding-body">
            <p class="finding-title">Cache headers <code class="rule">performance/cache-control</code></p>
            <p dir="auto">No Cache-Control header</p>
            
            <p class="fix"><span class="fix-label">Fix:</span> Send a Cache-Control header so browsers and CDNs can cache responses.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        
      </ul>
      <p class="ok">4 other checks passed.</p>
      
      
      
      <details class="metrics">
        <summary>Measurements</summary>
        
        <h4>Core SEO</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Title length</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">Recommended 30 to 60</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Description length</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">Recommended 70 to 160</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">H1 count</th><td dir="auto">1</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Exactly one</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">H1 length</th><td dir="auto">9 chars</td><td><span class="vs warn">warn</span></td><td dir="auto">Recommended 10 to 70</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Open Graph tags</th><td dir="auto">0 of 7</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">Missing og:title, og:description, og:image</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <caption>Open Graph</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Property</th><th scope="col">Content</th><th scope="col">State</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><td dir="auto">og:title</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">missing</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:description</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">missing</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:image</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">missing</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:url</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:type</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:site_name</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">og:locale</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <h4>Content</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Declared language</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">The lang attribute on &#60;html&#62;</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Hidden elements</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto">Inline display:none or the hidden attribute</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Inline style attributes</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Style belongs in a stylesheet</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Style blocks in body</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">CSS after &#60;body&#62; opens can restyle painted content</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">HTML comments</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Comments ship to every visitor</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Placeholder links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">href=&#34;#&#34; or empty</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Headings</th><td dir="auto">1</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">H1 1 · H2 0 · H3 0 · H4 0 · H5 0 · H6 0</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <caption>Headings per level</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Level</th><th scope="col">Count</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><td dir="auto">H1</td><td dir="auto">1</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">H2</td><td dir="auto">0</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">H3</td><td dir="auto">0</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">H4</td><td dir="auto">0</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">H5</td><td dir="auto">0</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">H6</td><td dir="auto">0</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <caption>Heading outline</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Level</th><th scope="col">Heading</th><th scope="col">Contains</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><td dir="auto">H1</td><td dir="auto">Not found</td><td dir="auto">-</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <h4>Links</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto">0 internal, 0 external</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Internal links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">External links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Dofollow links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Nofollow links</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Duplicated targets</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">URLs linked more than once from this page</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
        <h4>Images</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Images</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td>-</td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">With alt text</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">0 marked decorative, 0 with no alt attribute</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Missing alt</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Loaded over HTTP</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Insecure images break the padlock on an HTTPS page</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
        <h4>Crawlability</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">HTTP status</th><td dir="auto">404</td><td><span class="vs bad">bad</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Response time</th><td dir="auto">1 ms</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Robots meta</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">Absent means index, follow</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">X-Robots-Tag</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">The header form of the same directive</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Canonical URL</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Canonical matches this URL</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">robots.txt</th><td dir="auto">3 directives</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Declares 1 sitemap(s)</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Sitemap URLs</th><td dir="auto">3</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
        <h4>Social media</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Twitter tags</th><td dir="auto">0 of 6</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto">Falls back to Open Graph</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <caption>Twitter card</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Content</th><th scope="col">State</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><td dir="auto">twitter:card</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">missing</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">twitter:title</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">twitter:description</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">twitter:image</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">twitter:site</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr><tr><td dir="auto">twitter:creator</td><td dir="auto">-</td><td dir="auto">not set</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        <h4>Internationalization</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">hreflang alternates</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
        <h4>E-E-A-T</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Published</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Updated</th><td dir="auto">-</td><td><span class="vs missing">missing</span></td><td dir="auto"></td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
        <h4>Performance</h4>
        
        <div class="table-wrap"><table>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Metric</th><th scope="col">Value</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Note</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">HTML size</th><td dir="auto">0 KB</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">Raw document, before assets</td></tr>
          
          <tr><th scope="row">Script tags</th><td dir="auto">0</td><td><span class="vs ok">ok</span></td><td dir="auto">0 external, 0 inline</td></tr>
          
          </tbody>
        </table></div>
        
        
        
      </details>
      
    </div>
  </details>
  
</section>


<section aria-labelledby="skipped-h">
  <h2 id="skipped-h">Skipped rules</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">Reason</th><th scope="col">Rules</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr><td>needs browser or psi_key</td><td><code>accessibility/axe, performance/lcp, performance/cls, performance/ttfb, performance/dom-size, performance/page-weight, performance/request-count</code></td></tr></tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>


<section aria-labelledby="blocked-h">
  <h2 id="blocked-h">Blocked by robots.txt</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col">URL</th><th scope="col">Rule</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody><tr><td dir="auto">http://fixture.test/private/secret.html</td><td><code>Disallow: /private</code></td></tr></tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>

</main>
<footer class="foot">
  <p>sitevet <version>, report schema 1.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
